/// A PHC-formatted string that is structurally present but can never verify — the placeholder a
/// credential-blind CRUD create lands on. `PasswordHash::new` rejects it (no algorithm header), so
/// the verify path fails closed on any row created this way.
const NEVER_VERIFIES: &str = "(set via the guarded set-pin verb)";

